This placeholder exists so the choice is made deliberately rather than by
default. Before making the repository public, replace this file with a real
licence. The decision is a business one:

  - A permissive licence (MIT, Apache-2.0) maximises adoption and contribution,
    and allows anyone to lift the engine into a commercial product.
  - A source-available or non-commercial licence protects the engine as an
    asset, at the cost of reach.

Until then, no rights to use, copy, modify or distribute this work are granted.
